Hits the target on the arms with one rotating saw doing [126%, 137%, 146%, 153%, 160% (TL1-5)] damage and trying to maim it for [1, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turns.

Maimed foes deal [16%, 25%, 31%, 34%, 37% (TL1-5)] less damage.

The chance improves with your Physical power.

''Cutting your foes has never been so simple!''
